<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Thursday in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 595.40, up 2.30.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 274 to 258.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.05.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,815,710 compared with 24,309,810 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
